{
  "slug": "box",
  "name": "Box",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Work with your Box content directly from Claude Code — search files, organize folders, collaborate with your team, and use Box AI to answer questions, summarize documents, and extract data without leaving your workflow.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `box` (Foundation skill for working with Box), `box-legal-workflows` (Shared building blocks for Box-based legal workflows — Box collaboration role definitions, Box AI usage boundaries (what AI…), `box-legal-workflows-contract` (Automate contract review and monitoring with Box MCP — find new or expiring contracts, compare them against firm…), `box-legal-workflows-intake` (Automate legal client intake and onboarding with Box MCP — review intake documents for completeness against firm requirements,…), `box-legal-workflows-ma` (Build and manage M&A virtual data rooms with Box MCP — create secure due-diligence folder structures, scope role-based…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install box@claude-plugins-official` from `box/skills`.",
